- familiarity 0-20: 0 = an obscure machine nobody has seen; 20 = the viewer has seen, driven or ridden it.
- visual_potential 0-20: 0 = hard to show (abstract, tiny, static); 20 = a dramatic cutaway and visible energy flow.
- evergreen 0-10: 0 = a one-off news topic; 10 = people search for it all year.
- novelty 0-10: 0 = close to something the channel already covered; 10 = a new machine and a new angle.
